	(text "REFERENCE DESIGN: ENX 16 EASY XT\n\nENCODER:\nDifferential RS-422 outputs\nSupply voltage: 5 V\n3 channels: A, B, I\nA and B: Square-wave signals with a 90° phase shift, \nused to determine rotation direction and position\nI: Index pulse generated once per revolution (reference position)\nPosition: theta = CNT / 4096 * 360°\nAngular velocity: w = 2pidCNT / (4096*dt)\n\nDIFFERENTIAL RECEIVER (AM26LV32E):\nReceives differential signals from the 5 V encoder\nSupply voltage: 3.3 V\nOutput: 3.3 V logic signals\nVdiff >= +200 mV -> Y = 1\nVdiff <= -200 mV -> Y = 0\n1Y and 2Y must be connected to the same STM32 timer\n3Y must be connected to an STM32 index input\nConverts differential signals into digital logic levels;\nno communication protocol is involved\n\nCONNECTOR:\n10-pin, 2.54 mm pitch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.73 46.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e1e0adc4-6876-4827-9c3b-b3c38bb0f9fe")
	)
	(text "Pass low filter : \ntau,descente = RserieC = 0.47 us\ntau,montee = (Rpull-up + Rserie)*C = 2.68 us\nt10-90 = 2.2tau = 5.9 us\nfhall = n/60*p\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e35871ec-df3d-4709-92d5-f5baf8e60afe")
	)
	(text "CHA-"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 52.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ed5acc51-d88f-495c-ba7a-955ca8eef7d3")
	)
	(text "Unused inputs must not \nbe left floating to avoid \nspurious switching"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 46.99 82.55 0)
		(effects
